  "scope": "Lean model statements only (MC1 model, Mathlib oracle, transcribed literal accumulator and runtime helpers, pinned NamedV1 normal-return linking and operand/continuation ABI model, the selected v3 labelled interaction-net model, and issue #107's parsed-I64-instruction semantic model). No implementation theorem; in particular, no Rust implementation-correspondence theorem. The private_theorems list names every private or protected helper theorem: those are existence-checked by name, and their axioms are audited transitively through every inventoried theorem that depends on them, because Lean private names are not addressable from another module. The ownership per-word trace module and the `ownership-corpus` rows are kernel-decided statements about the model own checker; neither is an implementation theorem.",
